    "body": "@domenic Part of the consensus from the last TC39 meeting was that this change should be a proposal (already at stage 3) rather than just a PR to the spec, so this PR can already link to the final version of the host hook from the proposal rather than waiting for it to be merged in ECMA-262 (also because that will require two shipping implementations).",
